  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T01:10:03.898369Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T02:56:38.207896Z",
  "totalBlocks": 141,
  "translatedBlocks": 127,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1584cea28f756db",
      "translationZh": "过去几年里，扩展稠密语言模型的规模推动了大语言模型（LLM）领域的大部分进展。从早期的模型，如最初的 ULMFiT（约 30M 参数）或 GPT-2（1.5B 参数，在当时被认为“危险到不能发布”🧌），一路发展到如今拥有数千亿参数的系统，方法很简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c44a41cbe856e78",
      "translationZh": "更多数据 + 更多参数，带来更好的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d71132908e6944",
      "translationZh": "缩放定律强化了这一趋势，但稠密模型的规模扩展存在实际限制：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "788608e51acf7a48",
      "translationZh": "训练成本越来越高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c6fc80bff2f3c91",
      "translationZh": "推理延迟增加。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55ba0d4c7591d294",
      "translationZh": "部署需要大量内存和硬件资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3297ee4a4e1eeeb7",
      "translationZh": "这正是混合专家模型（MoEs）登场的地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef2c0b1fc6f98504",
      "translationZh": "如果你已经熟悉 MoE，并想直接了解 transformers 中所做的工程工作，可以直接跳到“Transformers 与 MoE”一节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e20f343972531ce3",
      "translationZh": "从稠密到稀疏：什么是 MoE？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edf6989f473193f5",
      "translationZh": "混合专家模型保留了 Transformer 主干，但将某些稠密前馈层替换为一组专家。“专家”并不是专精于某个主题的模块（例如“数学专家”“代码专家”），而只是一个可学习的子网络。对于每个 token，路由器会选择一小部分专家来处理它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f30f7057437259cb",
      "translationZh": "图 1：4 个专家中的专家 1 被激活（来源：Maarten Grootendorst）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc00b85306ee83ca",
      "translationZh": "不同的 token 会根据各自的隐藏表示激活不同的专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e422ebe0d9b8dc79",
      "translationZh": "模型容量取决于总参数量，而推理速度取决于激活参数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e02d56d0521f9cf9",
      "translationZh": "这就是核心思想。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc5c274e95154fe7",
      "translationZh": "例如，以 gpt-oss-20b 为例。它的总参数量为 21B，但对于每个 token，只会使用总共 32 个专家中的 4 个激活专家。将共享组件与激活专家一并计算，这个模型每个 token 使用的激活参数量约为 3.6B。在内存带宽约为 800 GB 的 M3 Ultra Mac 上运行这个模型时，我们可以估算，使用 bfloat16 时的生成速度约为 800 / (3.6 * 2)，其中每个参数占用 2 字节。由此得到的速度约为每秒 111 个 token。我们实际测得的性能约为 115 tok/s，与这个粗略估算非常接近。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c9a2f153fe7b138",
      "translationZh": "这种极快的速度证实，该模型运行起来大致相当于一个 3.6B 参数的模型，但其能力（或质量）却与一个 21B 参数的模型相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5a0613c0f64de94",
      "translationZh": "（注：如果我们使用针对该模型所采用的原生 mxfp4 量化的计算内核，速度还会更快。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8be616503f6de7bf",
      "translationZh": "MoE 之所以具有吸引力，原因如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38d2b64a31df4d72",
      "translationZh": "更高的计算效率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec5f22663bb9c1a0",
      "translationZh": "在训练 FLOP 预算固定的情况下，MoE 的表现往往优于对应的稠密模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6b89a27085834bc",
      "translationZh": "图 2：稠密模型与 MoE 的训练曲线（来源：OLMoE：开放的混合专家语言模型）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23ffcd482035c66b",
      "translationZh": "这意味着更快的迭代速度和更高的扩展效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70dffb86ff795274",
      "translationZh": "天然的并行化维度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93a191e0fbb7df57",
      "translationZh": "专家在计算图中提供了一种结构性边界。由于不同的词元会调用不同的专家，我们可以跨专家进行并行计算（稍后将在“专家并行”中讨论）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a5f5e5fd4681883",
      "translationZh": "行业采用情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92f5dc4f0516ef95",
      "translationZh": "过去几周发布的重要开放 MoE 模型包括 Qwen 3.5、MiniMax M2、GLM-5 和 Kimi K2.5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea14ea2650d8cd17",
      "translationZh": "在 DeepSeek V2 等早期系统的基础上，DeepSeek R1 于 2025 年 1 月取得成功后，这一趋势加速了。另一个早期的 MoE 模型是于 2023 年 12 月发布的 Mixtral-8x7B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c048841f2986ca0",
      "translationZh": "图 3：MoE 模型加入 transformers 库的两年时间线。DeepSeek R1 标志着一个明显的拐点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40f41fa4c6b292d1",
      "translationZh": "闭源实验室也使用 MoE。长期以来，一直有传言称 ChatGPT 使用了稀疏架构，而开放的 gpt-oss 模型则确实如此。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49d13e6e7e16951d",
      "translationZh": "如果你想更全面地了解 MoE，我们强烈建议阅读这篇博客，并观看我们最近在 YouTube 上发布的关于路由的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "556c16451b55fd8b",
      "translationZh": "Transformer 与 MoE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c391d74ebdb43ed0",
      "translationZh": "生态系统中的大多数工具，包括模型加载、设备放置、量化和后端执行工具，最初都是为稠密模型设计的。MoE 对这些设计假设提出了挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af04d2216300f851",
      "translationZh": "要让 MoE 在 transformers 中获得一等支持，就意味着要重新设计加载流水线、执行模型和分布式抽象的部分内容，而不只是添加新的模型类。我们将重点介绍 transformers 库如何演进，以在以下方面支持稀疏架构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5497b2ad50ff8d49",
      "translationZh": "权重加载重构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d49259a2eb16ab80",
      "translationZh": "专家后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d4952478841c305",
      "translationZh": "专家并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca13b0c70c6c1cc0",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers 训练 MoE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5497b2ad50ff8d49",
      "translationZh": "权重加载重构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae77f71229bb3ec0",
      "translationZh": "AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\"model_id\") 会下载模型权重，并将其加载到 PyTorch 模型中。对于稠密模型，加载过程相对直接，检查点中的每个张量都与运行时模块中的一个参数一一对应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44964504c8602f49",
      "translationZh": "对于 MoE，情况更加复杂。在大多数 MoE 检查点中，每个专家都是独立序列化的。如果查看 DeepSeek-V3 检查点的索引，你会看到这样的键：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fd856f51b093293",
      "translationZh": "每个专家都有自己的一组权重矩阵，本质上就是并排保存的 256 个小型前馈网络（以 DeepSeek-V3 为例，编号从 0 到 255）。然而在运行时，GPU 执行的是经过优化的内核。现代 MoE 内核，例如分组 GEMM 和融合 MoE 实现，旨在通过单次操作处理所有专家，而不是逐一循环处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e4d6d961d181e9d",
      "translationZh": "为了高效地做到这一点，它们要求将专家权重打包到一个连续的张量中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "154df64ae0b8e5b3",
      "translationZh": "因此，两者之间存在不匹配：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a50bb0abe68358da",
      "translationZh": "检查点：256 个独立的张量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5055c7a0047ee35b",
      "translationZh": "运行时：1 个打包后的张量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebe08377ee808e3e",
      "translationZh": "权重加载重构所实现的，正是系统性地弥合这一差距。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bb32f248079380b",
      "translationZh": "随着通用 WeightConverter 的引入，理解这一过程的思维模型发生了转变，原先是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "290d5a83388fdc1c",
      "translationZh": "检查点已经与我的运行时布局相匹配；加载基本上就是按键逐一复制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55708cb7df70bc7b",
      "translationZh": "转变为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a627b70edbb229ba",
      "translationZh": "检查点只是张量的序列化来源。加载是一条转换流水线，将这些张量转换成我们想要的运行时布局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5b074f8642960fa0",
      "translationZh": "使用 WeightConverter 动态加载权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcaf39b33cfad9d2",
      "translationZh": "这次重构引入的核心抽象，是通过 WeightConverter 动态加载权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d932ef3b372a4824",
      "translationZh": "WeightConverter 让我们能够定义：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbdaee62b34aef77",
      "translationZh": "基本操作（分块、拼接等）可以组合使用。其中有两种对 MoE 尤其有用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ecc5fbcb2ae4851",
      "translationZh": "MergeModulelist 将一个张量列表合并为单个张量。例如，你可以将 MergeModulelist 与 Concatenate 组合使用，把 MoE 中的专家堆叠起来，并打包到一个张量中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7f688836f58be49",
      "translationZh": "SplitModulelist 将一个张量拆分回张量列表。例如，你可以将堆叠在一起的专家拆分回各个独立的专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "975b10cd8a691507",
      "translationZh": "张量的惰性物化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0376303c6598e1a",
      "translationZh": "这次重构不仅改进了可用的转换，还改进了这些转换的调度方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bc0070da98796ee",
      "translationZh": "加载器只扫描一次检查点键，将它们与转换器模式进行匹配，并按转换器对张量进行分组。一旦某个键被确定为需要加载，就会将其注册为一个 future，并通过线程池进行物化。转换操作只有在其依赖项就绪后才会运行。例如，MergeModulelist 会等待某一层的所有专家都加载完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e3774184b259c27",
      "translationZh": "这避免了重复扫描，并降低了内存峰值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ae84883f00f1ad4e",
      "translationZh": "基准测试：权重加载流水线的改进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5636733f548b6027",
      "translationZh": "为了评估新的权重加载流水线带来的改进，我们对 transformers 的 v4 和 v5 版本进行了基准测试。测试重点是大型 MoE 模型的加载速度，这往往是训练和推理中的瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "294df31e6ba48f4b",
      "translationZh": "我们使用以下配置对 v4 和 v5 进行了基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
