      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "872887e563e75957",
      "translationZh": "示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "254f50c537aa541b",
      "translationZh": "两个相关的环境变量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8be5c3e3c4f6834",
      "translationZh": "HF_ENABLE_PARALLEL_LOADING：通过线程启用分片并行加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc0865bb319e9484",
      "translationZh": "HF_DEACTIVATE_ASYNC_LOAD：禁用新的异步流水线（v5 的应急回退开关）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
