    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73007a8f9f13b68f",
      "translationZh": "45.3秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88f22a6c21541c10",
      "translationZh": "异步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fab0ab0d51bcc08",
      "translationZh": "10.1秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d261a372fde1461",
      "translationZh": "同步",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a60948eafdc7bd7",
      "translationZh": "19.28秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b30491f0635a2e1",
      "translationZh": "图 4：加载性能基准测试（v4 与 v5 对比）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17afcc2827d5ad58",
      "translationZh": "加速并不只是靠“更多线程”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e7ab9fb65731e81",
      "translationZh": "它依靠单遍路由、异步物化和转换感知调度的结合，共同避免不必要的物化和内存峰值，同时支持在加载时进行专家打包和投影融合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d797d2103ca20c9d",
      "translationZh": "量化在哪个环节介入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0478ad91c677d6b",
      "translationZh": "通过这次重构，我们现在可以先创建运行时模块结构，再将权重转换到该结构中。现在，我们还可以选择在转换流水线中加入量化，使量化成为权重加载流水线本身的一部分。这一点至关重要，因为只有当专家以可预测的打包布局存在时，“逐专家”量化才有意义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66fd8d388bddd7ff",
      "translationZh": "此前无法实现这样的端到端流水线，而现在，用户可以通过公开的 API 使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d49259a2eb16ab80",
      "translationZh": "专家后端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7876bd548a4ea467",
      "translationZh": "一旦将专家打包到单个运行时张量中，另一个问题就出现了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4460eec2d4ad9cf6",
      "translationZh": "究竟如何高效地在这些专家之间进行路由？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6af0a63a8929c0f",
      "translationZh": "在混合专家模型中，每个 token 都会被路由到不同的专家。这意味着运行时必须将 token 分派到其选定的专家权重上，高效执行投影运算，应用路由权重，然后收集结果并重新排序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71b8fc3d1926352d",
      "translationZh": "这正是 Experts Backend 系统（在 PR #42697 中引入）所解决的问题。Experts Backend 引入了一种可插拔的执行架构，将专家计算与模型实现解耦。该系统不再在每个 MoE 模型内部硬编码一种分派策略，而是允许专家层在运行时动态选择后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d856ea30a27b8c61",
      "translationZh": "这是通过装饰器模式实现的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa8179a4024add20",
      "translationZh": "装饰器包装专家类，并自动将计算分派到所选后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c8646cb2aee215f",
      "translationZh": "目前提供三种后端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aebe7ae48e55a54",
      "translationZh": "eager 会循环遍历选定的专家，并对每个专家执行投影运算。它用作正确性参考和调试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dffbf387a9553d1",
      "translationZh": "batched_mm 使用 torch.bmm API。它会为每个 token 复制选定的专家权重，并执行一次批量 GEMM。该后端非常适合内存充足、批量较小且 GPU 计算负载较重的工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64e6f7ea361a6eb8",
      "translationZh": "grouped_mm 使用 torch._grouped_mm API。在这里，我们按专家 ID 对 token 排序、分组，然后执行一次分组 GEMM。该后端在大批量或内存受限的配置下表现出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf4c0d27ad68da7e",
      "translationZh": "图：专家后端示意图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d4952478841c305",
      "translationZh": "专家并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9f3441f46052bf4",
      "translationZh": "混合专家（MoE）模型可以拥有数千亿个参数（远远超出单个 GPU 所能容纳的范围）。专家并行（EP）通过将专家分布到多个设备上来解决这一问题。每个设备只加载分配给自己的专家子集，执行这些专家的计算，然后参与结果聚合。这种方法能够将模型扩展到大得多的参数规模，而不会增加计算成本，因为每个 token 只会激活少数几个专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bdaea8b306e0ebd",
      "translationZh": "通过 enable_expert_parallel 启用专家并行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feb0a46852712c14",
      "translationZh": "使用以下方式启动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "515d67489456aa76",
      "translationZh": "其中，N 能整除专家总数，也可能与你的节点中的 GPU 数量相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0294887cd241a7c",
      "translationZh": "当 enable_expert_parallel=True 时，模型会从标准的张量并行（TP）方案切换到采用专门分片策略的专家并行（EP）方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b669393a4c098cc6",
      "translationZh": "EP 的核心组件包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4dd0f3a7a33099c",
      "translationZh": "GroupedGemmParallel：沿专家维度（dim=0）拆分专家权重。这里，每个设备仅加载 num_experts / num_devices 个专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c030a9e6f58d89",
      "translationZh": "RouterParallel：将全局专家索引重新映射为本地索引，屏蔽未分配给当前 rank 的专家，确保每个设备仅使用其本地专家进行计算，并通过 all-reduce 合并各设备的部分输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a86b1663aaac2895",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers 训练 MoE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f7ef5a98e841d01",
      "translationZh": "MoE 非常适合扩展推理规模，但其训练要复杂得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06219c7e44c366d3",
      "translationZh": "MoE 的参数量极其庞大，分布式专家通信十分复杂，还存在需要处理的路由不稳定性。为了解决这些问题，我们与 Unsloth 合作，实现了速度显著提升的混合专家模型训练：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7566b6ad6479a75",
      "translationZh": "MoE 训练速度约为原来的 12×",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad259053d26d7fea",
      "translationZh": "显存占用减少 >35%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "201a55df37e99bf3",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度约为原来的 6×",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b6eb0567cd22c3e",
      "translationZh": "与 v4 相比，整体加速 12–30×",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a00064ef40403b6f",
      "translationZh": "我们利用 Expert Backend 抽象，以 PyTorch 的 torch._grouped_mm API 为统一标准，并使用自定义的 Triton grouped-GEMM + LoRA 内核。Unsloth 在 Transformers（以及 TRL）的优化基础上进一步提升性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2cd87e11b88bb95",
      "translationZh": "如需了解完整细节，我们建议阅读：Unsloth 官方指南",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6424350eb5a5d5ff",
      "translationZh": "随着稀疏架构不断演进，我们希望 transformers 库也能随之发展。如果你正在使用 MoE 进行构建，或尝试新的稀疏化思路，我们很乐意听到你的意见。请告诉我们，你希望接下来在 transformers 中看到哪些抽象、内核或工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
